Command.ВпередиЕсть.Title=(?\=template)
Command.ВпередиЕсть.ToolTip=Positive "looking ahead". Matches the source string at any point where pattern matching begins. This is an uncommitted match, which means that the match found is not stored for possible later use.
Command.ВпередиНет.Title=(?\! template)
Command.ВпередиНет.ToolTip=Negative "looking ahead". Matches the source string at any point where there is no pattern matching beginning. This is a non-committal match, which means that the match found is not stored for possible later use.
