Command.НачалоСтроки.Title=^
Command.НачалоСтроки.ToolTip=Corresponds to the position at the beginning of the input string. If the Multiline property of the RegExp object is set to True, ^ also matches the position after '\\n' or '\\r'.
Command.НеГраницаСлова.Title=\\B
Command.НеГраницаСлова.ToolTip=Matches all characters except word borders.
Command.НеИдентификатор.Title=\\W
