Command.Повтор01.Title=?
Command.Повтор01.ToolTip=Corresponds to the repetition of the preceding subexpression zero or once.\nAny other quantifier (*, +, ?, {n}, {n,}, {n,m}) declares the pattern "non-greedy"
Command.ПовторM.Title={,m}
Command.ПовторM.ToolTip=m and n are positive integers, and n <\= m. Corresponding to at least the nth and no more than the mth number of repetitions.
Command.ПовторN.Title={n}
Command.ПовторN.ToolTip=n is a positive integer. Corresponds to exactly n number of repetitions.
Command.ПовторБольшеN.Title={n,}
Command.ПовторБольшеN.ToolTip=n is a positive integer. Corresponds to at least n number of repetitions.
Command.ПовторОт0.Title=*
Command.ПовторОт0.ToolTip=Corresponds to the repetition of the preceding subexpression zero or more times.
Command.ПовторОт0НеЖадный.Title=*?
Command.ПовторОт0НеЖадный.ToolTip=Corresponds to the repetition of the preceding subexpression zero or more times.
Command.ПовторОт1.Title=+
Command.ПовторОт1.ToolTip=Corresponds to the repetition of the preceding subexpression one or more times.
Command.ПовторОт1НеЖадный.Title=+?
Command.ПовторОт1НеЖадный.ToolTip=Corresponds to the repetition of the preceding subexpression one or more times.
